<title>UK: BNG sets $150 million four-year bond.</title>
<headline>BNG sets $150 million four-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Nomura and UBS.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BANK NEDERLANDSE GEMEENTEN</p>
<p> AMT    $150 MLN	COUPON     3.25 PCT  MATURITY    16.JUL.01</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  90.925    PAY DATE    16.JUL.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.625     REOFFER    89.525    SPREAD	+3.5 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX/AMS   PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS  US/UK/JP/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NETHER    MGT/UND    0.225     SELL CONC   1.4</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
